WEBVTT

00:00:26.800 --> 00:00:27.800
Tokuko.

00:00:29.720 --> 00:00:31.130
Stop.

00:00:31.130 --> 00:00:32.760
Stay back!

00:00:32.760 --> 00:00:33.760
No!

00:00:36.680 --> 00:00:37.770
Stay away!

00:00:37.770 --> 00:00:39.810
Tokuko, stay strong!

00:00:48.030 --> 00:00:49.030
Shigemori.

00:00:51.530 --> 00:00:53.320
At least...

00:00:53.320 --> 00:00:56.370
At least spare the child!

00:00:56.370 --> 00:00:58.620
Please!

00:00:58.620 --> 00:00:59.620
Tokuko.

00:01:01.510 --> 00:01:16.220
THE HEIKE STORY

00:02:31.500 --> 00:02:36.420
Episode 4

00:02:31.960 --> 00:02:34.630
She is at last with child,

00:02:34.630 --> 00:02:37.430
but she suffers endlessly...

00:02:37.430 --> 00:02:40.600
Try not to let it trouble you too much.

00:02:40.600 --> 00:02:44.230
Tokuko will successfully bear your child.

00:02:44.230 --> 00:02:46.270
Lord Shigemori,

00:02:46.270 --> 00:02:49.520
I must express my thanks.

00:02:49.520 --> 00:02:52.730
I understand you intervened
with Lord Kiyomori to keep him

00:02:52.730 --> 00:02:54.820
from confining my father,

00:02:54.820 --> 00:02:57.530
at risk to your own life.

00:02:57.530 --> 00:03:01.280
Do not mention it. How is His Majesty?

00:03:01.280 --> 00:03:06.250
Having lost many aides,
he devotes himself to compiling <i>imayo</i>.

00:03:16.050 --> 00:03:20.300
Seeing my father brought low like this...

00:03:20.300 --> 00:03:23.770
Please tell him to take
care of himself for me.

00:03:23.770 --> 00:03:27.520
We of the Taira clan
are servants of the court.

00:03:27.520 --> 00:03:30.060
And we shall continue to be.

00:03:38.530 --> 00:03:40.780
Shigemori.

00:03:40.780 --> 00:03:42.280
What did you see?

00:03:44.950 --> 00:03:46.580
I saw Lord Saiko...

00:03:47.750 --> 00:03:53.590
...the late Lord Narichika,
whose exile to Bizen I failed to prevent,

00:03:53.590 --> 00:03:56.840
the three who were
exiled to Kikaigashima...

00:03:56.840 --> 00:03:58.340
...their ill will.

00:04:02.260 --> 00:04:06.350
Biwa, I need to go see my father now.

00:04:06.350 --> 00:04:09.600
He apparently happens
to be in the capital.

00:04:09.600 --> 00:04:12.190
Return to our home with Sukemori.

00:04:20.780 --> 00:04:22.570
Lady Iko!

00:04:22.570 --> 00:04:25.700
Please! Have eyes only for me!

00:04:27.620 --> 00:04:28.710
Lady Iko.

00:04:31.460 --> 00:04:32.830
Please wait!

00:04:46.970 --> 00:04:51.310
It seems Lady Iko has feelings
for someone besides me.

00:04:52.730 --> 00:04:56.020
It's a man nearly 20 years my senior,

00:04:56.020 --> 00:04:58.690
skilled in song and in art.

00:04:59.860 --> 00:05:04.370
Ah! I feel like my heart has
been toyed with! It's too much!

00:05:05.450 --> 00:05:06.910
That is a lot.

00:05:06.910 --> 00:05:10.540
No, I'm sure you don't
get it at all, Biwa.

00:05:10.540 --> 00:05:14.250
Have you ever loved someone, Biwa?

00:05:14.250 --> 00:05:16.590
You're always dressed like a guy.

00:05:16.590 --> 00:05:18.210
What?!

00:05:18.210 --> 00:05:21.220
Of course I've noticed. Everyone has.

00:05:21.220 --> 00:05:25.220
Though when you first arrived,
I thought you were a boy.

00:05:25.220 --> 00:05:28.010
Oh, of course...

00:05:28.010 --> 00:05:29.470
That's it.

00:05:29.470 --> 00:05:31.230
Yes, yes.

00:05:31.230 --> 00:05:33.140
Of course.

00:05:33.140 --> 00:05:36.520
I just need to find someone else too.

00:05:36.520 --> 00:05:39.650
Then her heart will be in pieces,

00:05:39.650 --> 00:05:43.780
and in her jealousy, "Lord Sukemori
is the one I love after all"!

00:05:43.780 --> 00:05:45.160
is what she'll realize!

00:05:45.160 --> 00:05:46.370
I wonder about that.

00:05:46.370 --> 00:05:47.530
How about it, Biwa?

00:05:47.530 --> 00:05:49.700
Give me your company tonight--

00:05:52.290 --> 00:05:53.290
Ow!

00:05:59.250 --> 00:06:05.340
You're saying Tokuko's troubles are due to
those punished for the Shishigatani plot?

00:06:05.340 --> 00:06:07.930
Yes. I suggest holding
a service for the dead

00:06:07.930 --> 00:06:12.020
and forgiving the
Kikaigashima exiles.

00:06:13.890 --> 00:06:16.690
To ensure a successful childbirth.

00:06:24.400 --> 00:06:28.870
As part of the prayers for Tokuko's safe
childbirth, pardons have been executed.

00:06:30.620 --> 00:06:34.160
Then we can return to the capital?

00:06:34.160 --> 00:06:37.960
Lord Shunkan, your name
is not on the document.

00:06:37.960 --> 00:06:38.960
What?!

00:06:42.340 --> 00:06:45.590
Take me too!

00:06:47.050 --> 00:06:52.020
♬ "So you would abandon
me in the end?" ♬

00:06:52.020 --> 00:06:55.270
♬ "Let me aboard! Take me with you!" ♬

00:06:55.270 --> 00:06:57.520
♬ Thus he cried out, ♬

00:06:57.520 --> 00:07:04.530
♬ yet the boat rowed on, leaving only
the normal wake of white waves. ♬

00:07:04.530 --> 00:07:08.870
♬ Though the boat was not yet far off, ♬

00:07:08.870 --> 00:07:13.790
♬ the tears welling up
carried it from his view. ♬

00:07:19.580 --> 00:07:23.460
Father refused to forgive Lord Shunkan.

00:07:23.460 --> 00:07:25.420
Why is that?

00:07:25.420 --> 00:07:28.800
The plotting occurred
at Lord Shunkan's estate.

00:07:28.800 --> 00:07:31.930
Father may harbor deeper
resentment because of that.

00:07:31.930 --> 00:07:33.970
Or perhaps...

00:07:33.970 --> 00:07:37.480
It appears that the other two showed
remorse by sending a thousand <i>sotoba</i>

00:07:37.480 --> 00:07:39.650
into the sea.

00:07:39.650 --> 00:07:42.400
I hear Lord Shunkan did not.

00:07:42.400 --> 00:07:44.030
That may be why.

00:07:45.900 --> 00:07:49.610
Nevertheless, I am told Lady
Tokuko's condition has improved!

00:07:49.610 --> 00:07:52.870
Biwa, we must visit at once
to congratulate her!

00:07:59.710 --> 00:08:02.790
Father, spin it again! Again!

00:08:02.790 --> 00:08:05.300
Why don't <i>you </i>give it a try this time?

00:08:05.300 --> 00:08:08.380
Yes, Father! Mother, watch me!

00:08:08.380 --> 00:08:11.890
Koremori, you're a Pa.

00:08:11.890 --> 00:08:14.350
Meanwhile, Sukemori is...

00:08:14.350 --> 00:08:18.810
The woman he loves is
a beauty and a skilled poet,

00:08:18.810 --> 00:08:21.940
so I imagine she has many admirers.

00:08:21.940 --> 00:08:24.190
Sukemori must have his own troubles.

00:08:26.280 --> 00:08:31.030
Anyway, Biwa, I would like
you to play for my wife.

00:08:31.030 --> 00:08:33.370
Perhaps it would comfort her.

00:08:33.370 --> 00:08:36.160
Thanks to Father's
intercession with Uncle,

00:08:36.160 --> 00:08:40.870
her father Lord Narichika
was spared a death sentence.

00:08:40.870 --> 00:08:45.550
But in exile in Bizen, he was not
provided proper food and perished.

00:08:47.420 --> 00:08:52.340
Once Lady Tokuko gives birth,
Uncle's power is sure to grow.

00:08:53.470 --> 00:08:55.470
Just what consequences will that have?

00:09:29.710 --> 00:09:32.680
My, well done, Tokuko!

00:09:32.680 --> 00:09:34.550
And a boy, no less!

00:09:34.550 --> 00:09:36.510
Let me hold him too!

00:09:40.560 --> 00:09:43.440
This child will be the next emperor.

00:09:43.440 --> 00:09:46.650
The Heike's glory
will reach further heights.

00:09:46.650 --> 00:09:49.190
Yes, there, there.

00:09:49.190 --> 00:09:50.990
What a lively child.

00:09:55.490 --> 00:09:57.410
He really is adorable.

00:09:58.580 --> 00:10:00.200
Yes, he truly is.

00:10:03.960 --> 00:10:05.130
Listen, Biwa.

00:10:06.420 --> 00:10:09.210
I heard that you can see the future.

00:10:10.460 --> 00:10:13.170
I wonder what lies in store for him.

00:10:13.170 --> 00:10:15.840
I don't care about my future.

00:10:15.840 --> 00:10:19.060
But his future...

00:10:19.060 --> 00:10:22.680
Can you see his future?

00:10:22.680 --> 00:10:24.900
Please, tell me.

00:10:24.900 --> 00:10:25.980
I can't see it.

00:10:27.270 --> 00:10:28.270
Oh...

00:10:29.230 --> 00:10:30.900
Goodness, what's wrong?

00:11:00.260 --> 00:11:01.930
Moriko.

00:11:01.930 --> 00:11:04.890
She was only 24...

00:11:04.890 --> 00:11:09.110
She was wed at nine and lost
her husband two years later.

00:11:09.110 --> 00:11:12.280
It must have been lonely for her.

00:11:12.280 --> 00:11:13.780
Then,

00:11:13.780 --> 00:11:16.910
why was no new husband
ever sought out for her?

00:11:16.910 --> 00:11:18.240
Tokuko.

00:11:18.240 --> 00:11:22.410
It was to hold on to
the assets Moriko inherited.

00:11:22.410 --> 00:11:24.750
Everyone is talking.

00:11:24.750 --> 00:11:28.460
They say the death of Taira
no Kiyomori's daughter Moriko

00:11:28.460 --> 00:11:33.300
was divine punishment for the
Heike snatching up Fujiwara assets.

00:11:39.890 --> 00:11:43.810
The whirlwinds last month were terrible.

00:11:43.810 --> 00:11:46.390
Homes and carriages alike were blown away,

00:11:46.390 --> 00:11:47.980
trees ripped from the ground,

00:11:47.980 --> 00:11:49.850
stones lifted into the air...

00:11:49.850 --> 00:11:52.980
Yet Father does nothing for the people,

00:11:52.980 --> 00:11:55.820
concerning himself only with
his grandchild and what happens

00:11:55.820 --> 00:11:58.030
to Moriko's assets.

00:11:58.030 --> 00:12:01.780
The <i>onmyoji </i>predict that within 100 days

00:12:01.780 --> 00:12:07.250
a great emergency will befall the
nation and successive war will follow.

00:12:07.250 --> 00:12:08.960
What do you think?

00:12:11.130 --> 00:12:14.500
What does that eye of yours show you?

00:12:14.500 --> 00:12:16.210
I don't want to look.

00:12:16.210 --> 00:12:20.890
If I can do nothing about what
I see, I'd rather not look.

00:12:20.890 --> 00:12:25.060
Of course.
There is nothing I can do now.

00:12:25.060 --> 00:12:28.810
Lord Narichika, who was part
of the Shishigatani incident,

00:12:28.810 --> 00:12:32.400
was my wife's brother
and Koremori's father-in-law.

00:12:32.400 --> 00:12:35.610
That has affected my position.

00:12:37.110 --> 00:12:39.860
The only thing I can do now is...

00:12:44.450 --> 00:12:46.200
I pray

00:12:46.200 --> 00:12:50.040
that my father Kiyomori
seek no further glory

00:12:50.040 --> 00:12:54.590
and that he take pains
to bring about peace.

00:12:55.840 --> 00:13:01.380
However, if the clan's glory
is to end with my father,

00:13:01.380 --> 00:13:05.970
that I might avoid seeing the
descendants of the Heike be disgraced,

00:13:05.970 --> 00:13:07.060
please,

00:13:07.060 --> 00:13:10.230
I pray that you shorten my life.

00:13:10.230 --> 00:13:12.270
I humbly beseech you.

00:13:33.630 --> 00:13:34.540
What is it?

00:13:34.540 --> 00:13:36.290
Just now, something came from your--

00:13:36.290 --> 00:13:39.210
No, it is nothing, Father.

00:13:39.210 --> 00:13:42.010
"I'm a little hungry,"

00:13:42.010 --> 00:13:43.390
Biwa said.

00:13:43.390 --> 00:13:44.390
What?!

00:13:45.260 --> 00:13:49.220
Forgive me.
We'd better be on our way then.

00:13:55.980 --> 00:13:57.230
It's cold!

00:13:57.230 --> 00:14:00.110
Really wakes you up, doesn't it?

00:14:00.110 --> 00:14:04.160
The sea at Itsukushima
that day wasn't this cold.

00:14:08.870 --> 00:14:10.290
That's cold!

00:14:10.290 --> 00:14:11.960
Take this, Biwa!

00:14:11.960 --> 00:14:13.290
That's cold!

00:14:13.290 --> 00:14:15.040
There! Take that, too!

00:14:15.040 --> 00:14:16.500
Lord Koremori...

00:14:16.500 --> 00:14:19.460
in this state, it's like he's
dressed for mourning.

00:14:20.880 --> 00:14:22.010
A change of clothes.

00:14:22.630 --> 00:14:25.090
No. No need.

00:14:33.310 --> 00:14:36.150
Sorry. Take it away.

00:14:36.150 --> 00:14:37.730
Father...

00:14:37.730 --> 00:14:39.900
You must eat something.

00:14:39.900 --> 00:14:43.700
I am sorry for worrying you. I am fine.

00:14:43.700 --> 00:14:45.860
--Don't push yourself!
--Please rest!

00:14:45.860 --> 00:14:48.740
Father, Emperor Go-Shirakawa is here.

00:14:49.830 --> 00:14:51.660
Have him let in.

00:14:55.000 --> 00:14:57.710
You did not need to go to such trouble.

00:14:57.710 --> 00:14:59.670
Don't be ridiculous.

00:14:59.670 --> 00:15:03.550
I am grateful for your loyalty.

00:15:03.550 --> 00:15:05.380
I am unworthy of your words.

00:15:07.510 --> 00:15:09.510
Pull yourself together.

00:15:09.510 --> 00:15:12.560
You are the head of the Heike.

00:15:12.560 --> 00:15:16.730
You have to live even
longer than Kiyomori.

00:15:16.730 --> 00:15:18.150
Please.

00:15:18.150 --> 00:15:19.400
Live.

00:15:30.990 --> 00:15:35.040
Shigemori looks as
though his vitality left him.

00:15:35.040 --> 00:15:41.800
Ever since his return from Kumano, he has
been on his sickbed and does not eat.

00:15:44.130 --> 00:15:46.720
How awful.

00:15:46.720 --> 00:15:49.510
What could have happened?

00:15:49.510 --> 00:15:51.180
Your Majesty,

00:15:51.180 --> 00:15:56.230
Kiyotsune here is an expert flute player.

00:15:56.230 --> 00:15:58.190
How does that matter?

00:15:58.190 --> 00:16:03.530
To see your face darkened
so brings us worry too.

00:16:03.530 --> 00:16:04.780
How about this?

00:16:04.780 --> 00:16:07.610
Shall we hope for Father's
recovery and sing?

00:16:09.410 --> 00:16:12.160
You are Shigemori's third son, yes?

00:16:12.160 --> 00:16:14.370
Y-Yes!

00:16:14.370 --> 00:16:17.000
We also have a <i>biwa </i>player.

00:16:22.750 --> 00:16:30.090
♬ Was I born to have fun? ♬

00:16:30.090 --> 00:16:35.270
♬ Was I born to play games? ♬

00:16:35.270 --> 00:16:41.480
♬ When I hear the shouts
of children playing, ♬

00:16:41.480 --> 00:16:43.650
♬ then even I ♬

00:16:43.650 --> 00:16:47.320
♬ am stirred. ♬

00:16:58.330 --> 00:17:00.170
Well done, Your Majesty.

00:17:03.840 --> 00:17:06.710
To carry on like that when you are unwell.

00:17:06.710 --> 00:17:11.260
It's fine.
Diversion is necessary in this world.

00:17:11.260 --> 00:17:16.220
Koremori, like your father,
you are they type to worry too much.

00:17:16.220 --> 00:17:18.890
Try not to put too much
strain on yourself.

00:17:20.980 --> 00:17:21.980
Father...

00:17:34.320 --> 00:17:35.740
Where am I?

00:17:35.740 --> 00:17:39.120
"Kasuga Daimyojin"

00:17:50.010 --> 00:17:52.680
The head of Kiyomori.

00:17:52.680 --> 00:17:57.930
His excessive villainy caused
Kasuga Daimyojin to take it.

00:17:57.930 --> 00:18:01.350
The Heike's destiny is now at an end.

00:18:03.310 --> 00:18:04.940
Amusing, is it not?

00:18:11.860 --> 00:18:13.110
Father!

00:18:15.820 --> 00:18:17.200
The Heike!

00:18:33.340 --> 00:18:35.720
Father, I have come.

00:18:38.100 --> 00:18:39.970
Father, you should be in bed!

00:18:41.680 --> 00:18:43.640
Thank you for coming.

00:18:46.610 --> 00:18:48.570
Koremori,

00:18:48.570 --> 00:18:50.480
this

00:18:50.480 --> 00:18:52.650
is for you.

00:18:52.650 --> 00:18:54.450
This...

00:18:54.450 --> 00:18:59.580
Is this Kogarasu, the Heike blade passed
down through the generations?

00:18:59.580 --> 00:19:05.620
No, this is a plain <i>tachi</i>,
to be worn at a funeral.

00:19:05.620 --> 00:19:10.090
It was for Lord Kiyomori's end.

00:19:10.090 --> 00:19:13.420
Why do you give it to me?

00:19:13.420 --> 00:19:16.180
I no longer--

00:19:19.390 --> 00:19:20.390
Father!

00:19:24.680 --> 00:19:29.520
I can no longer remonstrate
with Lord Kiyomori.

00:19:30.400 --> 00:19:35.740
Koremori, I ask that you
take this in my stead.

00:19:37.950 --> 00:19:39.570
Yes.

00:19:39.570 --> 00:19:40.620
I accept it.

00:19:43.410 --> 00:19:46.580
I built an island.

00:19:46.580 --> 00:19:50.630
So that ships can anchor in its lee.

00:19:50.630 --> 00:19:55.260
Lord Kiyomori, your ideas
surpass imagination.

00:19:55.260 --> 00:19:57.220
Amusing, is it not?

00:19:58.930 --> 00:20:00.760
Now, Tokitada.

00:20:00.760 --> 00:20:04.850
What business made you rush
all the way to Fukuhara?

00:20:06.310 --> 00:20:09.600
I am afraid Lord Shigemori is...

00:20:14.690 --> 00:20:15.990
Shigemori.

00:20:15.990 --> 00:20:17.110
Shigemori!

00:20:20.820 --> 00:20:21.700
Biwa.

00:20:21.700 --> 00:20:23.120
Shigemori!

00:20:23.120 --> 00:20:24.410
Shigemori.

00:20:25.330 --> 00:20:30.920
I was a boring man to the end, wasn't I.

00:20:32.750 --> 00:20:34.170
That's not true!

00:20:35.800 --> 00:20:37.050
I am sorry.

00:20:38.470 --> 00:20:42.220
I dragged you into this.

00:20:42.220 --> 00:20:46.220
Into the Heike's inevitable ruin.

00:20:49.900 --> 00:20:51.650
Play for me.

00:21:46.490 --> 00:21:48.750
This is all I can do.

00:21:51.250 --> 00:21:54.420
I'm powerless.

00:21:54.420 --> 00:21:58.210
Even though I can see it,
I can't do anything.

00:22:02.630 --> 00:22:03.840
Shigemori?

00:22:06.600 --> 00:22:07.850
Shigemori?

00:22:11.020 --> 00:22:12.390
Shigemori!

00:22:16.020 --> 00:22:18.780
Shigemori! Shigemori!

00:22:18.780 --> 00:22:20.530
No!

00:22:20.530 --> 00:22:22.150
Shigemori!

00:22:26.830 --> 00:22:28.120
Father!

00:22:28.120 --> 00:22:31.120
Father!

00:22:37.880 --> 00:22:38.880
Biwa.

00:22:41.550 --> 00:22:42.760
Shigemori...

00:22:45.800 --> 00:22:47.260
...Pa?

00:22:48.220 --> 00:22:50.640
You're there, aren't you?

00:22:50.640 --> 00:22:52.140
You're still there.

00:22:55.690 --> 00:22:56.900
Did I

00:22:56.900 --> 00:22:59.610
inherit Shigemori's eye?
